## Docker

Start infrastructure only:

```bash
make infra
```

Start app + infrastructure:

```bash
make docker-up
```

Build and start:

```bash
make docker-build
```

## Diagrams

PlantUML architecture and design diagrams are in `docs/diagrams/`. Render to PNG:

```bash
make diagrams
```

## Release

